{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-molecular-assembly-projector","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:molecular-assembly-projector","kind":"definition","title":"Molecular assembly projector $e_{\\lambda,\\mu}$","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-parabolic-hecke-subalgebra","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-h3-hecke-idempotents"],"tags":["assembly-projector","idempotent","jones-wenzl","wedderburn","delocalization","q-young-symmetrizer"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.Molecular.AssemblyProjector","text":"molecular-assembly-projector.md","leanSource":"molecular-assembly-projector.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:molecular-assembly-projector\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\lambda</code> be a strand-partition of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">N</code> and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mu \\vdash N</code> a Wedderburn block of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H_N(q)</code>. The <strong>assembly projector</strong> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">e_{\\lambda,\\mu} \\in H_N(q)</code> is the canonical idempotent projecting the composite's module onto the irreducible block <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mu</code>. The distinguished case <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mu = (N)</code>, projection onto the one-row symmetric block, is called <strong>delocalisation</strong>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/molecular-assembly-projector.md","heading":"Definition","number":"18.2.5","page":"b/def-molecular-assembly-projector","qa":{"counts":{"pass":82,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":10,"unknown":0,"stale":66},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.Molecular.AssemblyProjector","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/molecular-assembly-projector.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
